
form wrapper
  case make
    link value, like u64

task unwrap
  take w, like wrapper
  fork case, read w
    hook make, base value
      send back, read value

form maybe
  case some
    link value, like u64
  case none

task force-unwrap
  take m, like maybe
  fork case, read m
    hook some, base value
      send back, read value

form direction
  case north
  case south
  case east
  case west

task is-north
  take d, like direction
  fork case, read d
    hook north
      send back, mark 1
